---
title: "Phir Le Aaya Dil"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "G"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

[G]Phir le aaya dil [D]majboor kya [G]keeje

Raas na [G]aaya rehna [D]door kya [G]keeje

[D]Dil keh [C]raha use [G]maqammal kar bhi aao

Wo jo [Em]adhoori si [G]baat baaki [D]hai

Wo jo [G]adhoori si [D]yaad baaki [G]hai

Wo jo [G]adhoori si [D]yaad baaki [G]hai

[G]Karte hain hum aaj [D]qabool kya [G]keeje

Ho gayi [G]thi jo humse [D]bhool kya [G]keeje

[D]Dil keh [C]raha use [G]mayassar kar bhi aao

Wo jo [Em]dabi si [G]aas baaki [D]hai

Wo jo [G]dabi si [D]aanch baaki [G]hai

Wo jo [G]dabi si [D]aanch baaki [G]hai

[G]Kismat ko hai yeh [D]manzoor kya [Em]keeje

Milte [G]rahe hum [D]badastoor kya [G]keeje

[D]Dil keh [C]raha use [G]musalsal kar bhi aao

Wo jo [Em]ruki si [G]raah baaki [D]hai

Wo jo [G]ruki si [D]chaah baaki [G]hai

Wo jo [G]ruki si [D]chaah baaki [G]hai
